<title>POLAND: Poland to offer PLN 4.1 bln of T-bills in July. [CORRECTED 11:35 GMT]</title>
<headline>Poland to offer PLN 4.1 bln of T-bills in July. [CORRECTED 11:35 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Corrects figure in headline from 1.2 bln).</p>
<p>The Polish finance ministry will offer a total of 4.1 billion zlotys worth of T-bills at four tenders in July, the ministry said.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
